@EquipmentApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5056

### 查所有，应该返回 2 条
GET {{EquipmentApi_HostAddress}}/api/Equipment

### 查单个，应该返回 Line1-Press
GET {{EquipmentApi_HostAddress}}/api/Equipment/3

### 新增，应该返回 201，id 是 3
POST {{EquipmentApi_HostAddress}}/api/Equipment
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Line3-Drill", "status": "Normal"}

### 修改，应该返回 200，status 变成 Fault
PUT {{EquipmentApi_HostAddress}}/api/Equipment/3
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Line3-Drill", "status": "Fault"}

### 删除，应该返回 204，没有响应体
DELETE {{EquipmentApi_HostAddress}}/api/Equipment/3

### 再查所有，应该又回到 2 条
GET {{EquipmentApi_HostAddress}}/api/Equipment


### logging 测试 week2 -2
POST http://localhost:5056/api/equipment/1/logs
Content-Type: application/json

{"message": "Motor overheating", "level": "Error"}

###

POST http://localhost:5056/api/equipment/1/logs
Content-Type: application/json

{"message": "Routine check passed", "level": "Info"}

###

POST http://localhost:5056/api/equipment/1/logs
Content-Type: application/json

{"message": "Temperature high", "level": "Error"}


### 查询log


GET http://localhost:5056/api/equipment/1/logs?page=1&pageSize=2
### 应该返回最新的 2 条

GET http://localhost:5056/api/equipment/1/logs?page=2&pageSize=2
### 应该返回剩下的 1 条

GET http://localhost:5056/api/equipment/1/alerts?hours=24
### 应该返回 errorCount: 2

